From: "D.R.racer" <drracer@seznam.cz>
Subject: cubietruck: keep upstream DRAM clock 432 MHz, enable optional eMMC slot

Local override of Armbian's patch of the same name (the file name must stay the same):
same eMMC slot change, but the DRAM clock stays at upstream's 432 MHz.
Based on Armbian's patch by Igor Pecovnik.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5

--- a/configs/Cubietruck_defconfig
+++ b/configs/Cubietruck_defconfig
@@ -27,3 +27,4 @@
 CONFIG_USB_EHCI_HCD=y
 CONFIG_USB_OHCI_HCD=y
 CONFIG_USB_MUSB_GADGET=y
+CONFIG_MMC_SUNXI_SLOT_EXTRA=2
